  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 8 October 2003, the matter described above is lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\nThe proposed single-storey extension to the rear of the dwellinghouse having a width of 4.6m, depth of 2.0m, with a flat roof height of 3.1m, qualifies as Class A, permitted development within Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995.\r\n\r\nThe proposed extension therefore, does not require planning permission.\r\n",
